<p class="MsoNormal" align="justify" style="text-align: justify; line-height: 200%;"><span style="mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: Arial; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 200%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;">&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: Arial; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 200%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" align="justify" style="text-align: justify; line-height: 200%;"><span style="mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: Arial; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 200%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;"><strong>1.New Year:</strong>&nbsp;The market will close </span><span style="mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: Arial; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 200%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;">from&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: Arial; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 200%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;">January&nbsp;1st&nbsp;(</span><span style="mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: Arial; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 200%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;">Thursday</span><span style="mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: Arial; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 200%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;">) </span><span style="mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: Arial; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 200%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;">to </span><span style="mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: Arial; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 200%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;">January&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: Arial; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 200%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;">2nd</span><span style="mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: Arial; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 200%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;">&nbsp;(</span><span style="mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: Arial; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 20