<p class="MsoNormal" align="justify" style="text-align: justify; line-height: 200%;"><span style="mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: Arial; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 200%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;"><strong>4.Labour Day:</strong>&nbsp;The market will close from May&nbsp;1st&nbsp;(</span><span style="mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: Arial; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 200%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;">Friday</span><span style="mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: Arial; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 200%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;">) to May&nbsp;5th&nbsp;(</span><span style="mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: Arial; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 200%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;">Tuesday</span><span style="mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: Arial; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 200%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;">) and resume trading on May&nbsp;6th&nbsp;(</span><span style="mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: Arial; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 200%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;">Wednesday</span><span style="mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: Arial; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 200%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;">).</span><span style="mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: Arial; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 200%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
